==Battleground==
*1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 5.33~8 seconds<sup>160f~240f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 4~6 seconds<sup>120f~180f</sup>.
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPIs]] spawn, delay 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
**7 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPIs]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPIs]] spawn, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though this stage has only two enemies, they are sent out rather rapidly.  Using a lot of meatshields can help on preventing the enemies from advancing.

